<section id="connected" class="card" aria-labelledby="connected-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="connected-heading">Connected to roster and events</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Communication respects the same boundaries as <a href="/features/members/">members</a> and <a href="/features/events/">events</a>. An announcement for the build crew only reaches that team; an all-hands update goes wider. RSVP reminders and finance notices can pull the right people because they share the same underlying roster.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Used by <a href="/use-cases/youth-clubs/">youth clubs</a> for family updates and <a href="/use-cases/churches/">churches</a> for congregation messages. Sibling pillars: <a href="/features/members/">Members</a> · <a href="/features/events/">Events</a> · <a href="/features/finance/">Finance</a> · <a href="/features/automation/">Automation</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

