<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Communication FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can I target a message to one team only?</h3>
    <p>Yes. Announcements are scoped to teams you choose — handy for a coach, a small-group leader, or a finance committee.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Do you replace email or Slack?</h3>
    <p>We complement them. Today we do team announcements and email digests; Slack/Discord/text are on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a> so you can keep the channels people already check.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Can I schedule posts ahead of time?</h3>
    <p>Yes — set a future publish date and an expiration so posts appear when relevant and don’t clutter the feed afterwards.</p>
